 "remarks": "Nestled in the highly sought-after Sunrise Hill community, this pristine end-unit townhouse offers three spacious levels of move-in-ready living. Hardwood floors span the main level, featuring an eat-in kitchen with stainless steel appliances and a breakfast bar that seamlessly transitions into the dining area. Sliding glass doors open to a private deck and stone patio, perfect for outdoor entertaining. At the heart of the home, a generous living room centered around a cozy fireplace brings warmth and charm. Upstairs, you'll find three comfortably sized bedrooms with ample closet space and a full bath. The finished lower level expands your options with a versatile family room, a dedicated laundry area, and an extra bonus room ideal for a gym or home office. Residents enjoy fantastic amenities including a pool, tennis and pickleball courts, and playgrounds, plus quick access to I-95, the Merritt Parkway, and local shopping. Meticulously maintained, this home is ready for its next chapter.",
